ame>Niehaus</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Herndon</surname><given-names>DN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The effect of leukocyte depletion on smoke inhalation injury in sheep</article-title><source>Surgery</source><year>1988</year><volume>104</volume><fpage>208</fpage><lpage>215</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3400056</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>